##
## ## Notes
## Measured: raygui reports `1` on the click that flips it, so the state return is also the change signal.
##
## ## Memory
## Each PenguScript string is copied into a C string that the wrapper frees before returning; raygui keeps nothing.
##
## ## Example
## ```pengu
